.03em" class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8 section-title mx-auto max-w-3xl leading-tight text-gray-900">Say it, and it <span style="font-weight:700">gets done</span></h1><p class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8 mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500 md:text-xl">The moment you think of it, just say it. VoiceOS takes care of it, without you opening another app.</p></div><div class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8 sp-frame"><video src="/agentModeLaunchVideo.mp4" poster="/agentModeLaunchVideo-poster.webp" preload="none" playsInline="" aria-label="The VoiceOS Agent Mode film" class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8 sp-video"></video><button type="button" aria-label="Play the film" class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8 sp-play"><span class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8 sp-play-dot"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8"><path d="M5.5 5.14v13.72a1 1 0 001.5.86l11.04-6.86a1 1 0 000-1.72L7 4.28a1 1 0 00-1.5.86z" fill="white" class="jsx-380296b35a4e8ea8"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></section><section id="agent-in-apps" class="jsx-1531946181 relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24"><div class="jsx-1531946181 relative mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="jsx-1531946181 mb-8 text-center md:mb-10"><h2 class="jsx-1531946181 ia-head section-title text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">It works <span style="font-weight:600">with your favorite apps</span></h2><p class="jsx-1531946181 mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500 md:text-xl">Say it once and the reply is sent, the event is scheduled, without you opening a single app.</p></div><div role="tablist" aria-label="Pick an app" class="jsx-1531946181 ia-picker"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-label="Google Calendar" class="jsx-1531946181 ia-tab is-active"><span class="jsx-1531946181 ia-dot"><span class="jsx-1531946181 ia-dot-fill"></span></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria